      ],
      "description": "One field of a phase, by `name`:  its icon and label are drawn;  its prose is its children.  In an item's prose (anywhere prose goes), a labelled block by `label` instead:  `<epic-field label=\"Where\">` draws `Where:` before its prose, no icon (epic `epic-components` P14).",
      "noun": "field",
      "attributes": [
        {
          "name": "name",
          "kind": "enum",
          "values": [
