        },
        {
          "name": "pill",
          "description": "Under the review line, while marks, comments or Do Now requests wait and nobody can take them:  no Claude session reviewing (orange), or airplane mode;  once a Send or Do Now woke the epic, what the wake did (`Typed /epic review <name> into 🚧 <name>:  press Enter there`).  A click copies the review line's command."
        },
        {
          "name": "send",
