        },
        {
          "name": "state",
          "description": "The step label while the epic has a state, its icon and colour the state's (`$/epics/list/EpicState`):  in progress (blue half circle), errors (red:  every phase done, items need you), paused (grey:  phases left, untouched for days);  why on hover.  None for a future epic or a done one:  FUTURE or DONE says so."
